{"name":"condorcet_ordering_certificate_excludes_common_obstruction","v":1,"source_hash":"45b805d4a0679f68","lines":["n m q : ℕ","hn : 0 < n","P : Fin n → Equiv.Perm (Fin m)","S : Fin q → Finset (Fin m)","f : Fin q → Fin m","w : Fin q → ℕ","hcert : ∀ (σ : Equiv.Perm (Fin m)), (2 * ∑ i, if ∀ c ∈ S i, σ (f i) < σ c then w i else 0) < ∑ i, w i","⊢ ∃ i, 2 * #{v | ∀ c ∈ S i, (P v) (f i) < (P v) c} < n","score : Fin n → ℕ := fun v => ∑ i, if ∀ c ∈ S i, (P v) (f i) < (P v) c then w i else 0","hne : univ.Nonempty","hu : (∑ i, 2 * ∑ i_1, if ∀ c ∈ S i_1, (P i) (f i_1) < (P i) c then w i_1 else 0) < ∑ i, ∑ i, w i","hu' : 2 * ∑ v, score v < n * ∑ i, w i","⊢ 2 * ∑ v, score v < n * ∑ i, w i","hid : ∑ v, score v = ∑ i, w i * #{v | ∀ c ∈ S i, (P v) (f i) < (P v) c}","⊢ ∑ v, score v = ∑ i, w i * #{v | ∀ c ∈ S i, (P v) (f i) < (P v) c}","⊢ (∑ v, ∑ i, if ∀ c ∈ S i, (P v) (f i) < (P v) c then w i else 0) = ∑ i, w i * #{v | ∀ c ∈ S i, (P v) (f i) < (P v) c}","⊢ (∑ y, ∑ x, if ∀ c ∈ S y, (P x) (f y) < (P x) c then w y else 0) = ∑ i, w i * #{v | ∀ c ∈ S i, (P v) (f i) < (P v) c}","score : Fin n → ℕ := ⋯","⊢ ∀ x ∈ univ,","    (∑ x_1, if ∀ c ∈ S x, (P x_1) (f x) < (P x_1) c then w x else 0) = w x * #{v | ∀ c ∈ S x, (P v) (f x) < (P v) c}","i : Fin q","hi : i ∈ univ","⊢ (∑ x, if ∀ c ∈ S i, (P x) (f i) < (P x) c then w i else 0) = w i * #{v | ∀ c ∈ S i, (P v) (f i) < (P v) c}","⊢ ∑ a with ∀ c ∈ S i, (P a) (f i) < (P a) c, w i = w i * #{v | ∀ c ∈ S i, (P v) (f i) < (P v) c}","hnone : ¬∃ i, 2 * #{v | ∀ c ∈ S i, (P v) (f i) < (P v) c} < n","⊢ False","hbad : ∀ (i : Fin q), n ≤ 2 * #{v | ∀ c ∈ S i, (P v) (f i) < (P v) c}","⊢ ∀ (i : Fin q), n ≤ 2 * #{v | ∀ c ∈ S i, (P v) (f i) < (P v) c}","⊢ n ≤ 2 * #{v | ∀ c ∈ S i, (P v) (f i) < (P v) c}","hn' : ¬n ≤ 2 * #{v | ∀ c ∈ S i, (P v) (f i) < (P v) c}","⊢ 2 * #{v | ∀ c ∈ S i, (P v) (f i) < (P v) c} < n","hl : (∑ i, w i) * n ≤ 2 * ∑ v, score v","⊢ (∑ i, w i) * n ≤ 2 * ∑ v, score v","⊢ ∑ i, w i * n ≤ ∑ i, 2 * (w i * #{v | ∀ c ∈ S i, (P v) (f i) < (P v) c})",